           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"j", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Method", "->", " ", "\"\<Secant\>\""}]}], "]"}]}], "&"}], 
       "/@", 
       RowBox[{"Total", "/@", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         FractionBox[
          SuperscriptBox[
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"newmat", "-", "newematrix"}], ")"}], "2"], 
          RowBox[{"newematrix", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"1", "+", 
             RowBox[{"j", " ", "newematrix"}]}], ")"}]}]], ")"}]}]}]}], ";", 
     " ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"data", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           FractionBox["newgenetotals", "n"], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"1", "+", 
            RowBox[{"fittedjvalues", "*", 
             FractionBox["newgenetotals", "n"]}]}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Last", "[", "#", "]"}], ">", "0"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"mediandata", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"N", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Mean", "[", 
              RowBox[{"First", "[", "#", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"Median", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Last", "[", "#", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "&"}], "@", 
         RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"SortBy", "[", 
            RowBox[{"data", ",", " ", "First"}], "]"}], "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", 
            RowBox[{"i", ";;", 
             RowBox[{"i", "+", "99"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Length", "[", "data", "]"}], "-", "99"}]}], "}"}]}], 
       "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"params", "=", 
      RowBox[{"FindFit", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Log", "[", "mediandata", "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Log", "[", 
           RowBox[{"1", "+", " ", "\[Eta]", " ", "+", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\[Theta]", "*", 
             SuperscriptBox["E", "x"]}]}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\[Eta]", ">", "0"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\[Theta]", ">", "0"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\[Eta]", ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\[Theta]", ",", "0.1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "x"}], 
       "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Show", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ListLogLogPlot", "[", "data", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"LogLogPlot", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"1", "+", " ", "\[Eta]", " ", "+", " ", 
             RowBox[{"\[Theta]", "*", "\[Mu]"}]}], ")"}], "/.", "params"}], 
          ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\[Mu]", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
             RowBox[{"First", "/@", "data"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
             RowBox[{"First", "/@", "data"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"PlotRange", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"PlotStyle", "->", " ", "Red"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], 
     ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "params"}]}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.965029474711892*^9, 3.965029724114294*^9}, {
   3.965029767588723*^9, 3.965029811128416*^9}, {3.965029861062038*^9, 
   3.965029908779766*^9}, {3.9650299759592876`*^9, 3.965030001056531*^9}, {
   3.9650300323910427`*^9, 3.965030050047575*^9}, {3.965030080886397*^9, 
   3.9650300952946444`*^9}, {3.965030150280223*^9, 3.9650301782466087`*^9}, {
   3.9650311664045477`*^9, 3.965031273549402*^9}, {3.96503232619238*^9, 
