Cell["\<\
Note, on 3/26/26 a small bug in the code was found; the term \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]FindRoot[#== -1+n, {j,1}, Method-> \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Secant\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]...etc.\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] had been written as FindRoot[#== 1+n, {j,1}, \
Method-> \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Secant\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], i.e. with a \
+1 instead of a minus 1.  This was true in all of the TwoComponentC codes.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.983559081831258*^9, 
  3.9835591576728163`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ce4ef070-4493-47a7-a977-\
b8d64bbc395c"],

