Cell["\<\
The following cumulants are derived from using a Negative Binomial, rather \
than an PoissonLogNormal model for the underlying gene expression.  In \
addition, we will switch from \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]n\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] to \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]n-1\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] in our denominator.  The \
old version is the same code, but because of the way it is configured it \
consumes much more memory.  The version below is much better.  It also runs \
faster.  \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9799853492064*^9, 3.979985380591302*^9}, {
